nical journals: Is there a cure?&#x02014;I</article-title><source>Br Med J</source><volume>288</volume><fpage>841</fpage><lpage>843</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6423108</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi-0030190-b029"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Klein</surname><given-names>DF</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Peer review and data access</article-title><source>Cortex</source><volume>38</volume><fpage>412</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12146668</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi-0030190-b030"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Meguid</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>Shenkin</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Introduction: Nutritional supplements and the quest to improve human performance&#x02014;The need for the strictest standards and rigor when reporting clinical trials</article-title><source>Nutrition</source><volume>19</volume><fpage>955</fpage><lpage>956</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14624945</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi-0030190-b031"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>DeMaria</surname><given-names>AN</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Peer review: Better than the alternatives</article-title><source>J Am Coll Cardiol</source><volume>40</volume><fpage>1017</fpage><lpage>1018</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12225731</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pcbi-0030190-b032"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>DeBakey</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><year>1990</year><article-title>Journal peer reviewing. Anonymity or disclosure?</article-title><source>Arch Ophthalmol</source><volume>108</volume><fpage>345</fpage><lpage>349</lpage><pub-id pub-id-ty